'''angle-bracket''' (ang′gl-brak″et), ''n.'' A bracket placed at the vertex of an interior or exterior angle, and not at right angles to the sides.

'''angle-brick''' (ang′gl-brik), ''n.'' A brick molded to fit any angle other than a right angle, or used to ornament a quoin.

